Ah!

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.380
- If you have ever shaved
and then put aftershave on,

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:39.400
it does burn a bit

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.590
because there are micro tears of the skin

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:43.580
and when the alcohol seeps in there

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:45.580
it actually causes burning and stinging.

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:48.710
I actually had a horrendous
experience like this

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:50.910
when I went swimming in the Dead Sea.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.670
If you don't know what the Dead Sea is

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:54.800
all you need is a
picture to see the blocks

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.790
of salt floating in it and
I actually shaved my face

00:00:58.790 --> 00:01:00.720
before going and I actually think my body

00:01:00.720 --> 00:01:02.250
because I wanted to get an even tan.

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:03.580
When I went into the Dead Sea

00:01:03.580 --> 00:01:05.630
and I had those little
micro tears from shaving,

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:08.370
oh my God my body caught on fire.

00:01:08.370 --> 00:01:10.342
So, I know what he feels like.

00:01:10.342 --> 00:01:12.842
