(shelf crashing)

00:01:18.758 --> 00:01:19.591
- Oh!

00:01:19.591 --> 00:01:22.620
This is such a typical pediatric injury.

00:01:22.620 --> 00:01:25.630
Ankle sprains could be quite
common here, knee sprains,

00:01:25.630 --> 00:01:28.170
and also because the
shelves actually fractured

00:01:28.170 --> 00:01:31.300
and broke like that,
those wooden sharp edges

00:01:31.300 --> 00:01:33.690
can give you a serious,
serious laceration.

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:35.920
- Got some nice presents for ya.

00:01:35.920 --> 00:01:39.360
- Be a good little fellow
now and open the door.

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:41.250
(gun firing)
(Harry screeching)

00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:43.530
- I'm assuming based on his reaction

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:46.580
it hit him in the testicular area

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:48.170
and it had to hurt.

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:49.700
There's a lot of nerve endings there

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:50.840
and it's also quite dangerous

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:52.940
because there's a lot of blood flow there.

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:54.940
So, if you rupture some
of those blood vessels

00:01:54.940 --> 00:01:56.920
you actually get expansion and swelling.

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:58.480
It could actually lead
to a condition known

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:01.880
as testicular torsion where
the spermatic cord that leads

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:03.850
to the testicle actually kind of spins

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:07.490
on itself and cuts off the
circulation to the testicle

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:09.410
which leads to a lot more pain

00:02:09.410 --> 00:02:10.950
and even the testicle dying

00:02:10.950 --> 00:02:13.286
if it's not treated surgically in time.

00:02:13.286 --> 00:02:16.119
