doing the (squeaking)

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:26.610
is he had the wind knocked out of him.

00:02:26.610 --> 00:02:28.670
Imagine landing so hard

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:30.980
that it actually expels all the air out

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:33.830
and you're not able to
normally take a breath in

00:02:33.830 --> 00:02:36.120
because remember, in order
to take a deep breath in,

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:38.080
your body has to create negative pressure

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:39.420
in order to suck the air in.

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:41.200
And if you can't expand your ribs

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.160
'cause they just got hit

00:02:42.160 --> 00:02:46.020
and there days you can't create
the negative pressure needed

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.120
to take a deep breath.

00:02:49.062 --> 00:02:51.030
(chain rattling)
(iron scraping)

